<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Terms and Conditions | Airbnb Clone</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans leading-relaxed">
    <nav
      class="bg-white border-b px-8 py-4 flex justify-between items-center sticky top-0"
    >
      <div class="text-rose-500 font-bold text-2xl tracking-tight">airbnb</div>
      <a href="/signup" class="text-gray-600 hover:underline">Back to Signup</a>
    </nav>

    <main
      class="max-w-4xl mx-auto my-12 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm border rounded-xl"
    >
      <header class="mb-10">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 italic">Last Updated: May 9, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By creating an account on our platform, you agree to be bound by
            these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use
            our services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <hr />

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">2. User Roles</h2>
          <p class="mb-2">
            Our platform allows users to register as either a
            <strong>Guest</strong> or a <strong>Host</strong>:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
              <strong>Guests:</strong> Can browse, book, and review
              accommodations.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Hosts:</strong> Can list properties, manage bookings, and
              communicate with guests.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <hr />

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">3. Account Security</h2>
          <p>
            You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your
            password and account credentials. You agree to notify us immediately
            of any unauthorized use of your account.
          </p>
        </div>

        <hr />

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">4. Fees and Payments</h2>
          <p>
            Service fees are applied to bookings to help the platform run
            smoothly. All payment processing is handled by secure third-party
            providers. We do not store your full credit card details.
          </p>
        </div>

        <hr />

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">5. Termination</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate
            our community guidelines or engage in fraudulent activity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t text-center">
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6">
          Have questions?
          <a
            href="mailto:support@example.com"
            class="text-rose-500 hover:underline"
            >Contact Support</a
          >
        </p>
        <a
          href="/signup"
          class="inline-block bg-rose-500 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-rose-600 transition"
        >
          I Understand, Let's Go
        </a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
